  "street_name": "THE DRIVE",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed enlargement would extend beyond a wall forming a side elevation of the original dwellinghouse and would have a width greater than half the width of the original dwellinghouse. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, paragraph A.1(j)(iii) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;When taken together with the existing enlargement to which it would be joined, the proposal would result in a total enlargement that exceeds the limitations set out in Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A. The proposal therefore fails to comply with paragraph A.1(ja) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
